Arena hooks for the pinned OpenEEBUS examples.

WHY: disable implicit example monitoring providers so the configured provider is
the only source of test measurements. Heartbeat controls share state with the
native timer thread, hence the atomic fields and stop guard. Appended example
hooks live separately in *_hooks.c.inc because they need private example structs.
The pairing variant records native evaluation stages and restores persisted trust
before starting the service; native acceptance and timeout decisions stay native.

